# Performance & Cost Audit Command

When the user says **"run performance audit"**, **"performance audit"**, or **"run cost audit"**:

## What to do

1. Launch one subagent (generalPurpose) and instruct it to follow `docs/process/performance-cost-audit-process.md`.
2. Require output report at `docs/audits/performance-cost/YYYY-MM-DD-performance-cost-audit.md`.
3. Audit only. Do not make code changes.
4. After completion, summarize top findings and report location.

## References

- Process: `docs/process/performance-cost-audit-process.md`
- Reports: `docs/audits/performance-cost/`
